# The rules of this website's machine: what every programme the compiler produces, and
# every design on the leaderboard, is checked against.

ruleset "standard"
title "This website's machine"
about "Broadcast-controlled surface traps, as the compiler and the studio model them: every rule of the catalogue that is about a programme, a device drawing or the compiler's own claims."

use R0, R1, R2, R3, R4, R4b, R4d, R5, R6, R6b, R7, R7b, R7c, R8, R9, R10, R11, R12, R13, R14
use R15, R16, R17, R18, R19, R20, R21, R22, R23, R24, R25

param max_chain = 15
